<title>USA: Yields unchanged on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</title>
<headline>Yields unchanged on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields on all three of the Bond Buyer municipal bond indices are unchanged this week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 20-bond index of general obligation bonds calculated Thursday was 5.88 percent, unchanged from last week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 11-bond index of GO bonds was 5.79 percent.</p>
<p>The yield on the 30-year revenue bond index was 6.14 percent.</p>
<p>					Latest Previous Last Date</p>
<p>20 Bond Index			5.88%    5.88% 4/10/97</p>
<p>11 Bond index			5.79%    5.79% 4/10/97</p>
<p>Revenue Bond Index		 6.14%    6.14% 4/10/97</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
